          },
          "docs": "Validates authentication credentials without running a full scan. Provide `authentication` directly, or pass a `profileId` to reuse its saved authentication (optionally overriding it). Poll `GET /authentications/{id}` until `status` is FINISHED, FAILED, or CANCELED."
        },
